.TH AGENT-HOOK-PRE-SEARCH-MUSE 1 "2026-09-09" "agentguard" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agent-hook-pre-search-muse \- require symlink-following file search under Muse
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agent-hook-pre-search-muse
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agent-hook-pre-search-muse
is sourced by
.B agent-hook-pre-search
when the running agent is Muse. It blocks file-search calls whose
follow-symlinks option is absent or false, because rule and config trees
contain symlinked files that default search skips silently. Payloads
without a file-search shape pass through, and anything uninspectable
fails open, so unrelated tools and other agents are never affected.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The search call is allowed, possibly with warnings.
.TP
.B 2
The search call is blocked.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR agent-hook-pre-search (1)
